WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Wu Yang, Wu Yang, how are you?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,840
Pretty brother, wake up quickly

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:13,030
Are you awake? Where is Yoyo? Yoyo is with my husband.

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,500
I always feel uneasy

5
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,140
I also think there is something fishy

6
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:20,110
Our Yin family has been practicing medicine for generations and has never stood up.

7
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:23,670
Today's incident was too simple and crude

8
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:27,190
It's like the person behind him jumped over the wall

9
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,110
Mr. and Mrs. are here with the family.

10
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:31,470
Are you here to pick up Yoyo?

11
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,200
say something to them

12
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:38,120
What's wrong with Yoyo staying at our house tonight?

13
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:41,960
Didn't there many little animals save the young master today?

14
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:45,910
One stray cat in particular was particularly brave.

15
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,040
Miss Jiaojiao next door said

16
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:50,720
She had thrown in those cats before

17
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,100
Although there is no name for spending time with my family,

18
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:56,740
But that means we want us to thank Miss Jiaojiao

19
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:59,980
Those little animals are obviously forgotten.

20
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,080
I'll go meet them
